## `export_refute_simp`

``` hol4
Refute.export_refute_simp : string -> unit
```

Exports the named theorem to the persistent Refute simplifier set.

Every conjunct must be an equation whose conclusion is `c t1 ... tn = u`,
`c t1 ... tn`, or `~(c t1 ... tn)`, with a constant head `c`: the model
finder looks the clause up by that head.  A clause with no constant head
cannot be found again and is dropped with a warning.
